0..78 Comment "//! What a forward flow between data types does not decide yet, after directed"
79..93 Comment "//! univalence"
94..165 Comment "//! [Gratzer-2026-directed_univalence_simplicial_homotopy_type_theory],"
166..245 Comment "//! Definition 1.2: a data type is covered constructor by constructor only when"
246..326 Comment "//! each field is a closed type of the vocabulary, so a field naming a parameter"
327..404 Comment "//! and a type holding itself are refused. Each refusal names the issue whose"
405..425 Comment "//! steps take them."
426..429 Comment "//!"
430..505 Comment "//! - owes: #1835 — a field naming a parameter, and a type holding itself"
